(B) Is (c,flank) arithmetic in (q,14)? candidate: c = N/gcd(?) ; flank pattern:
  q  L=lcm  L/14    c  14c  14c-L flank  c==14/gcd(L/14,?)
  7     14     1    2   28     14     8                   
